{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221122_b82d6173","chunk_index":11,"job_id":"mwjob_bf28987c132c1b13527f252a","precondition_digest":"67d537499c47fe4ae0d786ec4ac18714b2af7d64fc584e8f1b34e1d9f712899a","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v5","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bd9d9224d94e0ac8","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_90b6de05a57a5bcc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bbc8a74bb7965cf9","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_26f3d31f974592dd"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221122_b82d6173","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bd9d9224d94e0ac8","fact_path":"picos.safety_endpoints","options":[{"label":"采用申办方统一安全性报告框架","option_id":"safety_reporting_project_standard","summary":"由申办方依据适用法规和项目风险建立AE/SAE定义、分级、因果关系判定及报告流程，方案正文引用该框架，具体时限和角色分工由医学作者确认。"},{"label":"采用监管通用安全性报告框架","option_id":"safety_reporting_regulatory_default","summary":"按适用监管要求的最低定义和报告原则撰写，不引入超出本项目已确认事实的额外分类或时限，医学作者在定稿时核对。"}],"question":"本章节不良事件、严重不良事件的定义、严重程度分级、因果关系判定及报告对象与时限应如何确定？","rationale":"已确认研究事实仅明确安全性终点和分析集，未提供AE/SAE定义、分级、报告对象与时限；该选项用于引导上游确认，不将选项内容作为既定方案正文。","recommended_option_id":"safety_reporting_project_standard"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bd9d9224d94e0ac8\n章节编号=7.3\n章节标题=安全性评估","quote_sha256":"2430375a3f0e1210f7f23f7a364929884fe46b9f647b0fe521c12c7772de2399","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","span_id":"sec_7_3_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"safety_endpoints_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"study_epochs_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"visit_strategy_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"safety_set_quote"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sec_7_3_identity","safety_endpoints_quote","study_epochs_quote","visit_strategy_quote","safety_set_quote"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"安全性评估","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的安全性评估覆盖双盲治疗期及安全性随访期。治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率属于安全性终点；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化同样纳入安全性终点。双盲治疗期为16周，其后设4周安全性随访期，并在第20周进行安全性随访访视。安全性分析集按实际接受的治疗划分。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持安全性终点包括TEAE、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件及实验室检查、生命体征、12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化；双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周、第20周安全性随访访视，以及安全性集按实际治疗分析。医学作者需核对AE/SAE定义、严重程度分级、因果关系判定、报告对象与时限等未在已确认来源中明确的实施规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bd9d9224d94e0ac8","section_number":"7.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221122_b82d6173","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_90b6de05a57a5bcc","fact_path":"picos.assessment_timing_restrictions","options":[{"label":"按计划访视统一评估","option_id":"vital_exam_all_protocol_visits","summary":"在筛选/基线、双盲治疗期各访视及第20周安全性随访进行生命体征和体格检查，具体时点与操作按项目安全性评估计划执行。"},{"label":"按关键访视评估","option_id":"vital_exam_key_visits","summary":"在基线、双盲治疗期部分关键访视及第20周安全性随访进行生命体征和体格检查，具体安排由医学作者确认。"}],"question":"生命体征和体格检查的评估时点、测量方法及异常结果临床意义判定标准应如何确定？","rationale":"已确认来源仅列出生命体征属于安全性终点之一，并给出第20周安全性随访，但未规定生命体征和体格检查的具体评估时点、测量方法及判定标准；需医学作者确认。","recommended_option_id":"vital_exam_all_protocol_visits"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_90b6de05a57a5bcc\n章节编号=7.3.1\n章节标题=生命体征和体格检查","quote_sha256":"807408a8550251378a8fac22108cac6501db9099b7eea8d24333bf16c3f10404","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","span_id":"sec_7_3_1_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"safety_endpoints_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"study_epochs_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"visit_strategy_quote"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sec_7_3_1_identity","safety_endpoints_quote","study_epochs_quote","visit_strategy_quote"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"生命体征和体格检查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"生命体征和体格检查作为安全性评估的组成部分，用于观察受试者在研究期间的体征变化。生命体征中具有临床意义的变化纳入安全性终点。安全性评估覆盖双盲治疗期及安全性随访期；双盲治疗期为16周，其后为4周安全性随访期，第20周进行安全性随访访视。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持生命体征属于安全性终点，并明确双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周及第20周安全性随访访视。医学作者需核对生命体征和体格检查的评估时点、测量方法、异常结果判定标准及记录方式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_90b6de05a57a5bcc","section_number":"7.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921221122_b82d6173","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bbc8a74bb7965cf9","fact_path":"picos.safety_endpoints","options":[{"label":"按计划访视统一检查","option_id":"ecg_all_protocol_visits","summary":"在筛选/基线、双盲治疗期各访视及第20周安全性随访进行12导联心电图检查，具体时点和判读流程按项目安全性评估计划执行。"},{"label":"按关键时间点检查","option_id":"ecg_key_timepoints","summary":"在基线、双盲治疗期部分关键访视及第20周安全性随访进行12导联心电图检查，具体安排由医学作者确认。"}],"question":"12导联心电图检查的评估时点、采集方式、中心判读安排及临床意义判定标准应如何确定？","rationale":"已确认来源将12导联心电图临床意义变化列为安全性终点，但未明确检查时点、采集方式、中心判读安排及判定标准；需医学作者确认。","recommended_option_id":"ecg_all_protocol_visits"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bbc8a74bb7965cf9\n章节编号=7.3.2\n章节标题=心电图检查","quote_sha256":"c5fcfbb450522dcfb23f49e063b7ebe7e9b1b6c4b0014fac04beac4ce6562f25","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a58cee7e4296c7610c84db5c","span_id":"sec_7_3_2_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"safety_endpoints_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"study_epochs_quote"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"visit_strategy_quote"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sec_7_3_2_identity","safety_endpoints_quote","study_epochs_quote","visit_strategy_quote"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"心电图检查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"12导联心电图检查纳入本研究安全性评估，其具有临床意义的变化作为安全性终点之一。安全性评估覆盖双盲治疗期及安全性随访期；双盲治疗期为16周，其后为4周安全性随访期，第20周进行安全性随访访视。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化属于安全性终点，并明确双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周及第20周安全性随访访视。医学作者需核对心电图检查时点、采集方式、中心判读安排及临床意义判定标准。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bbc8a74bb7965cf9","section_number":"7.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a58cee7e4296c76